<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>착한한끼</title>
<style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Noto Sans KR",sans-serif;color:#171a1f;background:#fff}button,input{font:inherit}.app{max-width:520px;margin:auto;padding-bottom:78px}header{padding:22px 18px 8px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}small,.muted{color:#7d858e}.loc b{display:block;font-size:19px;margin-top:3px}.bell{border:0;background:#f4f5f6;border-radius:14px;width:43px;height:43px}.search{margin:12px 18px 17px;background:#f3f5f6;border-radius:16px;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:8px}.search input{border:0;outline:0;background:none;width:100%;font-size:16px}.quick{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);padding:0 10px 20px}.quick button{border:0;background:white;font-size:12px;padding:4px 0}.quick span{display:grid;place-items:center;margin:auto auto 7px;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:17px;background:#eff8f5;font-size:23px}.hero{margin:0 18px 24px;background:#e9f8f3;border-radius:20px;padding:19px}.hero small{color:#188263;font-weight:800}.hero h2{margin:6px 0;font-size:21px}.hero p{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#587069}.section{padding:0 18px;margin-top:24px}.title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:12px}.title h2{font-size:20px;margin:0}.title button{border:0;background:none;color:#888}.cards{display:flex;gap:12px;overflow:auto}.deal{min-width:235px;border:1px solid #e9edef;border-radius:18px;padding:15px}.badge{display:inline-block;background:#e8f8f2;color:#168462;border-radius:7px;padding:5px 7px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.night{background:#f0efff;color:#6557c8}.deal h3{margin:10px 0 5px}.meta{font-size:13px;color:#7d858e}.price{font-weight:800;margin-top:10px}.old{text-decoration:line-through;color:#aaa;font-size:13px}.green{font-size:13px;font-weight:750;color:#168462;margin-top:7px}.rest{display:flex;gap:13px;padding:15px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2}.pic{width:92px;height:92px;border-radius:17px;background:#e6f0eb;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:36px;flex:none}.info h3{margin:2px 0 6px}.info p{margin:5px 0;font-size:13px;color:#7d858e}nav{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);max-width:520px;width:100%;height:70px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #edf0f2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}nav button{border:0;background:white;color:#8a929b;font-size:12px}nav span{display:block;font-size:21px;margin-bottom:3px}nav .on{color:#20ad82;font-weight:800}.view{display:none}.view.on{display:block}.empty{margin:35px 18px;padding:34px 20px;border-radius:20px;background:#f6f7f8;text-align:center}.empty div{font-size:44px}</style></head>
<body><main class="app"><section id="home" class="view on"><header><div class="loc"><small>현재 위치</small><b>내 주변 가성비 맛집⌄</b></div><button class="bell">🔔</button></header><label class="search">🔎<input id="search" placeholder="메뉴나 식당을 검색해보세요"></label>
<div class="quick"><button data-q="점심특선"><span>🍱</span>점심특선</button><button data-q="점심할인"><span>☀️</span>점심할인</button><button data-q="저녁할인"><span>🌙</span>저녁할인</button><button data-q="1만원"><span>💰</span>1만원 이하</button><button data-q="할인"><span>🔥</span>지금 할인중</button></div>
<div class="hero"><small>오늘의 착한 한끼</small><h2>지금 가까운 할인부터 확인하세요</h2><p>특선·시간대 할인 정보를 한눈에 모아 보여드려요.</p></div>
<div class="section"><div class="title"><h2>지금 받을 수 있는 혜택</h2><button>전체보기 ›</button></div><div class="cards">
<article class="deal item"><span class="badge">점심특선</span><h3>바다식당</h3><div class="meta">⭐ 4.7 · 420m · 한식</div><div class="price">제육정식 8,900원 <span class="old">11,000원</span></div><div class="green">11:00~14:00 · 평일</div></article>
<article class="deal item"><span class="badge night">저녁할인</span><h3>고기마을</h3><div class="meta">⭐ 4.6 · 760m · 고기</div><div class="price">저녁 메뉴 15% 할인</div><div class="green">20:00 이후 · 월~목</div></article></div></div>
<div class="section"><div class="title"><h2>내 주변 가성비 맛집</h2><button>지도보기 ›</button></div>
<article class="rest item"><div class="pic">🍲</div><div class="info"><h3>착한국밥</h3><p>⭐ 4.8 · 310m · 국밥</p><p>대표메뉴 9,000원</p><div class="green">🍱 점심특선 11:30~14:00 · 8,000원</div></div></article>
<article class="rest item"><div class="pic">🍝</div><div class="info"><h3>오늘파스타</h3><p>⭐ 4.5 · 650m · 양식</p><p>대표메뉴 12,000원</p><div class="green">☀️ 점심 10% 할인 · 평일 11:00~13:30</div></div></article>
<article class="rest item"><div class="pic">🥩</div><div class="info"><h3>동네고깃집</h3><p>⭐ 4.7 · 1.1km · 고기</p><p>1인분 13,000원부터</p><div class="green">🌙 20시 이후 일부 메뉴 20% 할인</div></div></article></div></section>
<section id="near" class="view"><header><div class="loc"><small>내 주변</small><b>가까운 착한 식당</b></div></header><div class="empty"><div>📍</div><h2>내 주변 지도</h2><p class="muted">다음 단계에서 GPS와 실제 지도 데이터를 연결합니다.</p></div></section>
<section id="saved" class="view"><header><div class="loc"><small>찜</small><b>저장한 식당</b></div></header><div class="empty"><div>♡</div><h2>아직 찜한 식당이 없어요</h2></div></section>
<section id="my" class="view"><header><div class="loc"><small>마이</small><b>내 정보</b></div></header><div class="empty"><div>👤</div><h2>착한한끼 회원</h2><p class="muted">리뷰·제보·찜·계정 설정을 관리합니다.</p></div></section></main>
<nav><button class="on" data-v="home"><span>⌂</span>홈</button><button data-v="near"><span>⌖</span>내 주변</button><button data-v="saved"><span>♡</span>찜</button><button data-v="my"><span>♙</span>마이</button></nav>
<script>const ns=[...document.querySelectorAll("nav button")],vs=[...document.querySelectorAll(".view")];ns.forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{ns.forEach(x=>x.classList.remove("on"));b.classList.add("on");vs.forEach(v=>v.classList.toggle("on",v.id===b.dataset.v));scrollTo(0,0)});function f(q){q=q.toLowerCase();document.querySelectorAll(".item").forEach(x=>x.style.display=!q||x.innerText.toLowerCase().includes(q)?"":"none")}document.querySelector("#search").oninput=e=>f(e.target.value);document.querySelectorAll(".quick button").forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>f(b.dataset.q));</script></body></html>
